	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020110"},
		line=971,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"On the way home from the concert, someone calls out to me as I enter a deserted alleyway.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“That was quite the performance, acting chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What do you want?”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“C'mon, don't be giving one of your admirers such a scary look.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"He thrusts a bouquet of flowers at me.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This isn't like you.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Won't you accept 'em?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Well, I don't mind if you toss 'em, even if they came from\nTokita's shop.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I see.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"I decide to shut up and take them.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Neither the flowers nor Soujin did anything wrong.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“This was the first time I've ever heard that sorta music. Damn near put me to sleep.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“It ain't nothin' but cheap sympathy for good-for-nothin' losers to drown their sorrows in.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't look down on music like that. People need hope in their lives.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Well, well, spoken like a true professional.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Might as well hang up your blade already, don’tcha think?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You know full well what I'm doing all this for.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“To make everyone... Er, what was it? 'Hippity-happity,\nhurray?'”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“To finance the Blades' activities.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Ah, right, right.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Maki sarcastically claps his hands.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's enough. Get to the point.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"When I glare at him, he finally drops his smile.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“It's about Kokuan.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“D'you still intend to rescue him?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm not about to change my mind that easily.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“This ain't the time to be worryin' about old bastards like him.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Any time you spend rescuin' him'd be better spent trainin' instead.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Makin' yourself stronger would be the best thing you could do for the Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I...”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I ain't gonna ask you again after this.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“So think long and hard before you give me your answer.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Maki stares resolutely at me.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"But my answer isn't going to change no matter how much he tries to intimidate me.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I will save my father.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“For the future of the Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Maki says nothing.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"He stares at me for a while longer before finally letting out a small sigh.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Only then does he takes a letter out of his breast pocket.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“One of those so-called ≪fan letters≫ for you.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"I let out a gasp when I see what's written on the back.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"“Letter of Resignation”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What the hell is the meaning of this?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Once I'm out of the picture, the Sworn Blades will be united.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You won't have any need for Kokuan then.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You'd go that far just out of─”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hatred, yes...”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“But you know what, I hate you even more.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Because I'm a woman?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“There's that, too.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Maki strokes his chin with a brazen smile.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Well, good luck with the Blades from now on, acting chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oh, that's right. You ain't my superior anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“No need to call you that anymore, eh, Inou?”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Maki flashes his canines at me.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Are you planning to take the Koubukan's disciples with you?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"If that happens, the Sworn Blades will be split down the middle.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I'll let 'em do whatever they want.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Though, I doubt most of 'em'll wanna follow you, the way you are now.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What are you going to do? Attack the Imperial Palace by yourself?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“And what if I do?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll stop you by force.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oh?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Maki's lips curl upwards.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"The air grows tense.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"My hand instinctively reaches for my hip out of muscle memory, but my trusty blade is nowhere to be found.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"I'd taken it off in response to the blade prohibition that was announced this morning.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ugh?!”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Maki grabs me by the throat with his tree trunk of an arm.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"He lifts me up before I can even resist.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"The tips of my toes futilely scrabble against the ground.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You've lost your damn edge.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“So... ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"this",
{"/font"},
" is our chairman, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm the acting─”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Aaagh!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"He slams my back against the nearby wall.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Shut the fuck up. I'm sick and fuckin' tired of hearing that!”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Ain't the Inous s'posed to be tougher than this?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Gh... gnnh...”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"I try to talk back, but it takes everything I have just to draw breath.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“What the fuck happened to your ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"spirit!",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You've lost your goddamn mind! Gettin' all wet over some guy!”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Since when... did I... lose my mind?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Ever since that Miyaguni woman showed up.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“As soon as that bitch came into the picture, your head's been up in the fuckin' clouds.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Some goddamn warrior you are! Getting into a fuckin' catfight over some flowerboy...”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Khh...”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"He's seen all the way through me, huh?",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"How incredibly pathetic I am...",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You'd best not be expecting anything outta Tokita, you hear?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hate to break it to you, but he's only puttin' up with you\n'cause Kokuan asked him to.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"I feel a pang in my chest at this.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Wh-What do you mean by that?”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'I entrust Hotori to thee.' Those were Kokuan's last words to him.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Father said that...?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“On top of that, he owes you big time for takin' care of him.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“That's the only reason he's been puttin' up with you all this while.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Open your damn eyes.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“D'you seriously think any warrior would ever take ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"you",
{"/font"},
" for a wife?”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"A cold wind whistles through the hollows of my heart.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Maki is right.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"What in the world was I expecting?",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Soujin would never possibly choose me.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Get it straight.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Spitting this at me, Maki finally loosens his grip.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"I collapse pathetically to the ground, unable to even stand.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“*Cough!* *Cough cough...!*”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You'd best get your shit together before Tokita gets sick of you.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“At this rate, you're gonna turn the Sworn Blades into another Myougi Squad.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Don'tcha think you oughta step down before you get the Blades annihilated?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Khh...”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Maki unceremoniously turns his back on me.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"He fades into the darkness without sparing a single glance backwards.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"I stay slumped over in the alleyway long after he disappears.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"The ground is as cold as ice.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"The crumpled bouquet rolls about in the chill breeze.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'At this rate, you're gonna turn the Sworn Blades into another Myougi Squad.'”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Over and over, his haunting words echo in my ears.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Another... Myougi Squad?)”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(I'm gonna... get everyone...!)”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"My heart leaps violently in my chest, and my breath catches in my throat.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"I can't stop myself from trembling.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(*Gasp!*)”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"I can still hear it...",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"I can still hear it, as clear as day.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"The screeching of war machines, the screams of agony, the cut-flower sound of lives scattering to the wind─",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The Warrior District is burning...”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"That day, three years ago─",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"The Republic's aerial bombing of the Warrior District was the harbinger of war.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"I, along with the rest of the Myougi Squad, gape down at the burning Warrior District from the hilltop we're running drills on.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Arai"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama, it's a war. We're really at war!”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, this means war!”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"The Myougi Squad is a cohort comprised of Myougikan disciples who have yet to come of age.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"It bears the impressive name of House Inou's dojo, but it was founded with the goal of fostering camaraderie among its members, rather than as an actual combat unit.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Put simply, I'm essentially playing house with children.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"But it is precisely because of this that we yearn so desperately for battle.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"When we saw the Warrior District in flames, our hearts were filled not with fear or anger, but with excited anticipation for what is to come.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"And the person who felt this most of all was me, their captain.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"I clamber atop a raised position and thrust my fist high toward my hundred-strong squad.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Attention! Attentiooon!”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The Warrior District is under attack even as we speak.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The damage is enormous. Many other squads are surely ill-prepared for combat.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But, Oomikami saw to it that the Myougi Squad is assembled here unscathed!”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"The youths raise a loud cheer at this.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We cannot allow the Empire's two-thousand-year history to end here!”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The Myougi Squad shall save the Empire!”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Those without fealty are welcome to flee!”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Those with fealty in their hearts, follow my lead!”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Not a single warrior turns their back.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Each and every one of them stares up at me with fire in their eyes, their cheeks flushed with anticipation of the imminent battle.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"I feel an indescribable surge of morale flaring up among their ranks, ready to be unleashed at the enemy.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Draw your blades!”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"The battlefield is hellish beyond our wildest imaginations.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Imperial warriors and Republican soldiers alike are consumed by its frenzy.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Every last combatant is naught but a savage beast, letting out inhuman roars as they clash.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Sanity has no hold here.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Some continue to mindlessly hack away at fallen enemy soldiers until they're beyond all recognition.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Some repeat an endless two-step of standing and stumbling, not realizing one of their legs is missing.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Some merely stand motionless, their minds scorched to cinders, only to be reduced to silent heaps of flesh in the very next moment.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"No matter where I look, madness the likes of which I've never imagined sears itself into my consciousness, all transfigured into one helter-skelter maelstrom of chaos.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Keep moving! Stop and you're dead!”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Move it! Move it! Move it! Move it! Move iiiit!”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"I can't even tell if I'm screaming to my comrades or to myself.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"All I can do is hack apart anything that stands in my way as I drown in the gouts of spraying blood.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Arai"},
			{
"“Hotori-samaaaaa!”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"The warrior who dives in front of me bursts like a water balloon.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Did he... protect me?",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"I don't know.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"I don't know anything anymore.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"I mechanically wipe my comrade's gray matter off my face, even as I cleave through another pair of enemy soldiers.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"My momentum carries me soaring through the air, and I land right in the midst of an enemy platoon.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"In less time than it takes for a spinning top to complete a revolution, all that remains is a circular spray of dripping blood.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"And yet, the enemy still abounds as more and more of their reinforcements crawl out of the woodwork.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Any sympathy I felt for taking a life has long since dissipated, and all that remains is the dull sensation of cold steel in my hands.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Who's... next...?",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Who's next?",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Who's next?!",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"Who's next?!!!",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"My trusty spellblade thirsts for more blood, shimmering brighter and brighter with each soul it claims.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haaaaaaaaahhhh!”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"After our fifth sortie, my remaining comrades number only six.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"We have been so thoroughly decimated that we no longer even qualify as a squad.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Who's still standing?”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kawada, Saitou, Hori, Tachikawa, Kasai... Mori... and\nthat's it...”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Soujin isn't here.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"He headed off on his own right before the bombing.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"I wonder if he's still alive.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Mori"},
			{
"“How many did you slay, Hotori-dono?”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You think I could still keep count?”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Mori"},
			{
"“I remember up to my thirtieth, but I totally lost track after that.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Mori"},
			{
"“Man... war sure is exciting, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"He shows me a wide smile, his pearly white teeth stained pitch-black with blood and grime.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Tachikawa, what happened to your right arm?”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Tachikawa"},
			{
"“I'm afraid I dropped it somewhere.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Tachikawa"},
			{
"“Haha... real embarrassing, ain't it?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Well, you've always had a bad habit of being careless, I suppose.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Still, you're left-handed, aren't you? You'll be just fine.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Tachikawa"},
			{
"“You remember that, ma'am? It's an honor!”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"I take the time to talk to all of them individually.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Each and every one of them is even more animated than when they're gossiping about girls.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Yet, despite the broad smiles they're all wearing, nobody can stop the tears that drip down their cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Their false sense of bravado is the last, flimsy line of defense keeping their broken selves together.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Even though we've come this far, I can still give the order to retreat.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"No... it's too late for that.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"If there was any time for us to retreat, it was right after we finished our first sortie.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"But I was consumed by the madness of the battlefield and lost my composure as their commanding officer.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"All the lives of the fallen...",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"All those comrades whose deaths I caused... they're never coming back.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"No... it's far too late for that.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"As their captain, the only thing I can do for them now is offer up my own life and fight to the very end.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Alright, it's about time we move out.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Khh...!”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"When I try to stand, my feet refuse to obey.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Apparently I'm wounded somewhere.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Mori"},
			{
"“You should rest for a little longer, Hotori-dono.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Mori"},
			{
"“We'll go and raise another ruckus while you do.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Like hell. You think I'll let you hog all the glory?”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"I plant my feet firmly on the mangled, blood-slicked ground.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Behold. Those enemy warships looming on the horizon.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Tachikawa"},
			{
"“They're huge. Each one is practically a fortress.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't you want to test your steel on them?”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Tachikawa"},
			{
"“What a coincidence, ma'am. I was thinking the exact same thing.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"I point my spellblade straight at the warships off the coast.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Time for the final charge of the Myougi Squad!”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Our objective: the enemy warships!”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Whoever claims first blood shall be handsomely rewarded!”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"A raucous choir of cheers goes up.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Steel yourselves, comrades.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"I take a good look at everyone's faces one last time.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Chaaaaaaarge!”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Immediately, my vision is engulfed in bright red, whether from the haze of blood or bloodlust.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"I run and run and run.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"One after another, my comrades fall.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"I knew all along we'd never even reach the sea, let alone the warships.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Cut them down! Cut them all down!”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ghh!!”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"...Huh?",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"What... happened?",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"Was the sky... always this color?",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"Forward. I have to face forward.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"I have to keep moving.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"But my body defies my will and refuses to budge.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"I can't even tell where I'm wounded.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"All I can do is stare as the darkness encroaches on the edges of my vision.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"Ah, so this is death.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"It is nothing as glorious or as beautiful as I imagined.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"How cold... How terrifying...",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"The exhilaration of battle suddenly evaporates, leaving no trace.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"All that remains is a chillingly cold, endlessly deep abyss.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"An eternal darkness that stares back at me.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Terror crushes down upon me, as though to bury me alive in the embrace of the blood-soaked earth.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Help... me...)”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Please don't let me die...)”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(I'm scared... I'm so scared...)”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Someone... Anyone...? Anyone...?!)”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“!?”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"Suddenly, the sound of footsteps.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"The telltale footfalls of a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"No, multiple warriors.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"Thank goodness. They've come to save me.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Th-Thank you...”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"With the last of my strength, I force my eyelids open.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"Surrounding me where I lay collapsed on the ground are more warriors than I can even count.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"They're all faces I know.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"They've all come for me.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"Everyone from the Myougi Squad.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"Tears begin to blur my vision.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"I should never have made you charge in again and again.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"I should have sounded a retreat before it was too late.",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“H-Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"Squinting through my tears, I suddenly notice the boy in front of me is missing both his arms.",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"The youth next to him is hobbling on one leg.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"Beside him, someone else doesn't even have his head.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Wh-What!?”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"─I didn't wanna die.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"The armless warrior lets out a terrible wail.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"─I wanted to live.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"─Why didn't you let us retreat?",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"─Why did you make us charge into a doomed battle?",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I-I...”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"─It's all your fault.",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			{
"─You're the one who killed us.",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Stop...”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"─Why are you the only one that survived?",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"─Why you of all people?",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"─Why?!",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"─Why?! Why?! Why?! Why?!",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"─Why?! Why?! Why?! Why?! Why?! Why?! Why?! Why?! Why?! Why?! Why?!!!",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“!!!”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haah, haah! Haah... haah...”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"I snap myself out of the nightmare.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
"My breathing is ragged, and my body is drenched with a cold sweat.",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I... killed them...!”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"Whenever I think back on it now, I realize that ours was the height of folly.",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"We yearned for the battlefield out of callow ignorance, and when madness eclipsed our sanity, we charged straight into our deaths, drunk on a tragic sense of destiny.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"The result: every other member of the Myougi Squad killed in action, leaving only me behind.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"Why was I the only one to survive?",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"Why couldn't I have gone on with them?",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			{
"I have no answer.",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"I've spent the three long years since the war drowning in regret and remorse.",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"And I will continue to do so, for as long as I live.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"This is the only life I deserve.",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“At this rate, you're gonna turn the Sworn Blades into another Myougi Squad.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Don'tcha think you oughta step down before you get the Blades annihilated?”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"Maki's parting remarks replay themselves again in the back of my ears.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"You're absolutely right, Maki.",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			{
"I'm not fit to be chairman.",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			{
"I know that better than anyone.",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			{
"That's why I have no other choice but to put everything on the line to rescue my father.",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"...I hope you'll forgive me, Maki.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
